"The Artonan Ambassador Bash-nor lives in this mansion in Punta de la Luna."
"Its terraced garden runs down to a brick lane over the seaside cottages and boardwalk."
"A long reception room has shuttered floor-to-ceiling windows opening onto a verandah."
"Its floor is a muted rainbow puzzle of wooden stars and diamonds that school trips come to see."
"Its double doors are carved with the logogram for 'welcome'."
"It has tapestries, carved alcoves, a windowless parlor, a large bar and a laundry by the kitchen."
"A sink by the bar incinerates disposed substances with blue flames."
"A closet-sized monitor room shows the front garden, verandah and back yard."
"The hot, damp greenhouse smells of nutmeg and lemon; its roof opens for escape flyers."
"The house is not magically shielded, though people assume it is a chaos fortress."
"It kept a dozen escape flyers, silver eggs that fly a preset course without the System."
"Ambassadors hold many parties there and let Avowed test their powers against the house."
"Zeridee-und'h, the Ambassador's assistant, stayed there during the Matadero disaster."
"Burglars attacked the house that night, stabbing Zeridee and stealing a flyer."
"Zeridee killed all three Avowed burglars, who planned to loot Artonan offices."
"The house and its greenhouse were destroyed by the flood that night."
